OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours angry at shop's 24/7
OL,4,Adelivery noise
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Co-op store's 24/7 delivery service
OL,7,Fhas sparked a row with neighbours who
OL,8,Fsay drivers are keeping them awake at
OL,9,Fnight as they come and go into the
OL,10,Fearly hours.
OL,12,FPeople living in Earlham House off
OL,13,FEarlham Road in Norwich have complained
OL,14,Fto the city council about the problem
OL,15,Fand asked why the store was allowed to
OL,16,Fprovide 24-hour deliveries close to
OL,17,Fhomes.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
