OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours angry at shop's 24/7
OL,4,Adelivery noise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Co-op said that it had put signs in
OL,7,Fthe window urging delivery riders to
OL,8,Fkeep the noise down and had also made
OL,9,Fother changes to minimise any
OL,10,Fdisturbance.
OL,12,FJennifer Davies, 33, who has lived in
OL,13,FEarlham House for four years, said: "We
OL,14,Fhave hundreds of delivery drivers
OL,15,Fzooming in and out. They're rushing in,
OL,16,Fslamming on brakes, playing music.
